        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "101a5086-dca4-3a41-96b5-3554c50e818c",
                "word": "vestige",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f5de33ba-816b-451d-bf5c-a7643af3732b",
                        "entry_id": "101a5086-dca4-3a41-96b5-3554c50e818c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "vestiges"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0f004eff-6b52-31c3-80d8-0707785859f3",
                        "entry_id": "101a5086-dca4-3a41-96b5-3554c50e818c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Empreinte du pied d’un homme ou d’un animal, marquée dans l’endroit où il a marché."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated",
                            "formal"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2d532b53-ef00-323f-9ce7-5a2cc16c2518",
                        "entry_id": "101a5086-dca4-3a41-96b5-3554c50e818c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Restes d’une chose détruite ou disparue ; ruine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Le plus souvent au pluriel"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "10ce9268-a397-4c04-8cc0-0a7e71386a00",
                                "sense_id": "2d532b53-ef00-323f-9ce7-5a2cc16c2518",
                                "text": "Dans dix ans, parmi les vestiges de Beaumat, les souffles du vent, les croassements des corbeaux et la chute des pierres retentiront seuls ; nulle oreille humaine ne les entendra et la cloche du village elle-même se taira, fatiguée de tinter seulement pour les morts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d3fa44a-a9a1-431c-ae67-1eb49e6de8d0",
                                "sense_id": "2d532b53-ef00-323f-9ce7-5a2cc16c2518",
                                "text": "Dans les environs, deux merveilleuses églises : celle de Ham-en-Artois, vestige imposant et vénérable de l'abbaye Saint-Sauveur; celle de Guarbecque, près de la petite ville de Saint-Venant, où triomphe aussi l'art roman."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30068ea9-3537-4973-a047-f3b9a3b44f85",
                                "sense_id": "2d532b53-ef00-323f-9ce7-5a2cc16c2518",
                                "text": "Dans tous les éloges qu’en ont faits les auteurs des trois premiers siècles, nous ne trouvons aucune prière ni aucun vestige d’invocation adressée aux martyrs."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "73fdbd2f-fc70-34ed-b62a-463cadc747c1",
                        "entry_id": "101a5086-dca4-3a41-96b5-3554c50e818c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Souvenirs d'une chose abstraite ; trace."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "01234e03-c70b-477b-9afa-e98b4a8a09d5",
                                "sense_id": "73fdbd2f-fc70-34ed-b62a-463cadc747c1",
                                "text": "On trouve dans leur pays des vestiges de cette religion, de cette coutume."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d97ecb5b-4542-4061-9004-5be3d75a2469",
                                "sense_id": "73fdbd2f-fc70-34ed-b62a-463cadc747c1",
                                "text": "Il ne restait pas chez ce peuple un seul vestige de sa grandeur passée."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ce03299-2b84-4b2a-a02d-3bd7d8fdbc9a",
                                "sense_id": "73fdbd2f-fc70-34ed-b62a-463cadc747c1",
                                "text": "Les derniers vestiges de cette révolution sont effacés."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "81282959-979f-34c2-80ab-185cd8a49ddf",
                        "entry_id": "101a5086-dca4-3a41-96b5-3554c50e818c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Organe ou structure réduit, atrophié ou sans fonction apparente, vestige d’une fonction ancienne."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Biologie fonctionnelle"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b1238ef-f245-45c9-8587-c30fbf2c6761",
                                "sense_id": "81282959-979f-34c2-80ab-185cd8a49ddf",
                                "text": "Mais qu’a-t-il de si particulier, ce crabe ? À côté de nombreux aspects morphologiques spécifiques (citons seulement des yeux réduits à un vestige membranaire, l’animal étant aveugle), c’est la présence des soies qui a retenu l’attention des chercheurs."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1a77ec27-3786-3639-b456-a7074fea0e37",
                        "entry_id": "101a5086-dca4-3a41-96b5-3554c50e818c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Structure réduite ou sans fonction, ou bien structure qui conserve la trace de son origine évolutive, même si elle exerce aujourd’hui une autre fonction."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Biologie évolutive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "680230ab-132f-48e9-bb78-481faf326ef9",
                                "sense_id": "1a77ec27-3786-3639-b456-a7074fea0e37",
                                "text": "Un exemple remarquable de vestiges est celui des osselets auditifs des Mammifères. En effet, leurs embryons retracent au cours de leur développement les étapes de l’évolution qui ont transformé des os de la mâchoire des Reptiles en des osselets auditifs, à savoir marteau, enclume et étrier."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "80cc53b3-ce5c-47c2-8dec-8c2b75bdd79d",
                        "source_entry_id": "101a5086-dca4-3a41-96b5-3554c50e818c",
                        "target_lang_word": "vestige",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vestige",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7dddab4-6f7a-395c-be37-cf70ec70a9cb",
                                        "entry_id": "75cdd26e-084b-356e-8877-ea925655620b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mark left on the earth by a foot."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13feb42b-10c2-3a1b-969d-efdf1ce9568e",
                                        "entry_id": "75cdd26e-084b-356e-8877-ea925655620b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A faint mark or visible sign left by something which is lost, or has perished, or is no longer present."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b42ba108-db15-41a4-8bee-5dc44bb80f4b",
                                                "sense_id": "13feb42b-10c2-3a1b-969d-efdf1ce9568e",
                                                "text": "The result, therefore, of this physical inquiry is, that we find no vestige of a beginning,— no prospect of an end."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e1126f4-6cc9-4cf8-9d12-11e01885e516",
                                                "sense_id": "13feb42b-10c2-3a1b-969d-efdf1ce9568e",
                                                "text": "the vestiges of ancient magnificence in Palmyra"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a92380c-8a11-492b-bc91-9d2a481381bf",
                                                "sense_id": "13feb42b-10c2-3a1b-969d-efdf1ce9568e",
                                                "text": "vestiges of former population"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8589519f-2a03-4fc6-a4d9-9d7672589d96",
                                                "sense_id": "13feb42b-10c2-3a1b-969d-efdf1ce9568e",
                                                "text": "Her face was without a vestige of colour, but it only showed more strongly the perfect outline of her features. Pale she was, but not like a statue; it was a human paleness—passionate and painful."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "228db7ae-6edb-4a56-af81-a678d2fe30f0",
                                                "sense_id": "13feb42b-10c2-3a1b-969d-efdf1ce9568e",
                                                "text": "Nevertheless in some cases, my original view, that the points are vestiges of the tips of formerly erect and pointed ears, still seems to me probable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0bb4a4e-9458-4cd8-a3ce-aa666367a030",
                                                "sense_id": "13feb42b-10c2-3a1b-969d-efdf1ce9568e",
                                                "text": "Only ragged vestiges of glass remained in its windows, and great sheets of the green facing had fallen away from the corroded metallic framework."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e6067ee-2f7d-46f8-9d8e-23472fb8d925",
                                                "sense_id": "13feb42b-10c2-3a1b-969d-efdf1ce9568e",
                                                "text": "The chief remains of the Roman Calagurris are the vestiges of an aqueduct and an amphitheatre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "562bb3af-5213-4f54-a0bd-6aa0d12a6b86",
                                                "sense_id": "13feb42b-10c2-3a1b-969d-efdf1ce9568e",
                                                "text": "The hovel stood in the centre of what had once been a vegetable garden, but was now a patch of rank weeds. Surrounding this, almost like a zareba, was an irregular ring of gorse and brambles, an unclaimed vestige of the original common."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f447b1a-e843-3061-a6b5-ed54b70a22ad",
                                        "entry_id": "75cdd26e-084b-356e-8877-ea925655620b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A vestigial organ; a non-functional organ or body part that was once functional in an evolutionary ancestor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4404ed0d-be0b-4a1b-9726-8087418a2835",
                                                "sense_id": "9f447b1a-e843-3061-a6b5-ed54b70a22ad",
                                                "text": "Any person seeing such a condition could not help being frightened at the conditions found, and it seems to me that that fact should lead us to think that the appendix is a vestige or becoming so."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "198fa7ca-27bd-4601-9e18-ace22f4b9072",
                                                "sense_id": "9f447b1a-e843-3061-a6b5-ed54b70a22ad",
                                                "text": "Now this paired organ of Jacobsen began in reptiles and is well developed in many mammals. But in man it is a vestige, often disappearing altogether; and the two openings are closed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ee34600-6a06-499c-ae67-fb1ff195ed11",
                                                "sense_id": "9f447b1a-e843-3061-a6b5-ed54b70a22ad",
                                                "text": "This idea was confirmed by Scott, who performed a detailed comparative analysis of primate anatomy and demonstrated conclusively that the appendix is derived for some unidentified function and is not a vestige."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e73ea08a-e09d-3fe8-ab53-290e98513cf5",
                                        "entry_id": "75cdd26e-084b-356e-8877-ea925655620b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The remaining portion of a partially suppressed sideband."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3becc59-a66a-4fb2-a588-9c22f177b840",
                                                "sense_id": "e73ea08a-e09d-3fe8-ab53-290e98513cf5",
                                                "text": "[J]ust a trace, or vestige, of the other sideband is included. In the receiver detection circuitry the vestige of the lower sideband is added to the upper sideband."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
